/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:354:Simulate water pixels falling under gravity into basins formed by colored obstacles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:355:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:356:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:357:- bg = 0. Water pixels = color 1 (blue).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:358:- Other colors form static solid structures (walls, steps, containers).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:359:- Water starts in unstable positions above or beside basins.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:360:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:361:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:362:- Each water pixel falls straight down through bg cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:363:- When blocked below, it slides diagonally through the unique open side cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:364:- When resting on a surface, it slides horizontally toward the nearest gap where it can fall again.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:365:- Process repeats until no water pixel moves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:366:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:367:Key insight: Water seeks the deepest reachable basin via diagonal and horizontal sliding, not just vertical fall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:368:</description>
