/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:373:Complete a sparse grid by casting occluding diagonal rays from the longest run and filling the remaining diagonal-connected regions from the short bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:374:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:375:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:376:- Black-background grid with one unique longest 4-connected foreground object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:377:- The longest object is a horizontal or vertical multicolor run; all other foreground objects are shorter monochrome bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:378:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:379:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:380:- On a blank canvas, process the longest run from left to right or top to bottom; each pixel emits four 45-degree rays that stop at the first already-painted pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:381:- Each remaining monochrome bar fills every still-blank pixel reachable from it by diagonal steps.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:382:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:383:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:384:- Earlier pixels in the long run occlude later diagonal rays, and those ray barriers partition the background into diagonal-connected regions for the short bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:385:</description>
