/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:392:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:393:- The grid has a dominant background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:394:- One or more two-row markers sit on the left edge; each marker is a 2x2 block whose left column is an object color and right column is its halo color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:395:- Away from the markers, every source color from the legend appears as one or more 4-connected monochrome objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:396:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:397:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:398:- Keep the input pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:399:- For each source-color object, take its tight bbox expanded by one cell and clipped to the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:400:- Recolor background pixels in that expanded region to the marker's halo color, except for background holes enclosed by the object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/prompt.md:401:
