/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:42:Fill every lattice slot from the color assigned to that slot position by the other lattices.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:43:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:44:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:45:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:46:- The largest foreground color forms several one-pixel-thick rectangular lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:47:- The frame lines divide each lattice into the same row-by-column set of rectangular slots; some slots already contain one non-frame color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:48:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:49:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:50:- Infer a color for each logical slot position from the colored slots across all lattice frames.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:51:- Repaint every slot interior in every lattice with the inferred color for its row/column position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:52:- Keep the frame lines and all background outside frames unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:53:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:54:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:55:- Slot sizes vary by frame, but the complete color pattern is indexed by lattice slot position rather than by absolute pixel size or location.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:56:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:57:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:58:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:59:  "type": "move_to_match",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:60:  "src": "colored slot s in any lattice frame",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:61:  "dst": "slot interior d in any lattice frame",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:62:  "match_cond": "s.logical_slot_position == d.logical_slot_position",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:63:  "transform": "fill d with s.color, preserving frame lines and outside background"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:64:}
