/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:81:Predict the next panel in a framed sequence by continuing each scheduled colored interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:82:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:83:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:84:- The grid is made from three or more equal panels in one row or one column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:85:- The final input panel is the static target template; every earlier panel differs from it only by dynamic colors absent from the template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:86:- Each dynamic color appears in a regular temporal schedule across the earlier panels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:87:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:88:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:89:- Keep the final template panel as the output canvas.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:90:- For every dynamic color whose schedule reaches the next panel, compare its last two appearances.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:91:- Extrapolate each one-dimensional interval along the color's changing row or column axis and paint that predicted mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:92:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:93:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:94:- The task is not asking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:95:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:96:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:97:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:98:  "type": "symmetry/pattern",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:99:  "src": "sequence of equal rectangular panels ending with a blank/static template panel",
