/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:154:Push the central solid rectangle to the grid edge, splitting the perpendicular target rectangle around its path.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:155:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:156:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:157:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:158:- There are exactly three monochrome foreground objects arranged on one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:159:  horizontal or vertical axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:160:- The middle object on that axis is a solid rectangular moving object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:161:- One end object is a solid rectangle or bar whose long side is perpendicular
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:162:  to the movement axis; this is the target to split.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:163:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:164:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:165:- Move the middle rectangle along the axis toward the target until it is
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:166:  flush with the grid edge in that direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:167:- Clear the original middle rectangle and the original target.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:168:- Split the target through the moving rectangle's two-cell-wide path and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:169:  shift the two halves one cell outward perpendicular to the movement.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:170:- Keep the other end object unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:171:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:172:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:173:- The non-target end object acts as a pusher; the central rectangle travels
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:174:  away from it through the perpendicular target, opening a matching gap.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:175:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:176:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:177:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:178:  "type": "move_along_path",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:179:  "src": "middle solid rectangular object between two end objects",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:180:  "path": "straight horizontal or vertical line away from the non-target end object and through the perpendicular solid target rectangle/bar",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:181:  "dst": "place flush with the grid edge beyond the target",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:182:  "trajectory": "paint only the final moved rectangle at dst",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:183:  "transform": "erase original source pixels; split the target rectangle/bar along the moving object's two-cell-wide path and shift its two halves one cell outward perpendicular to the movement; keep the other end object unchanged"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:184:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:185:</annotation>
