/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:201:Paint the inner foreground color into every background pixel that touches the enclosing frame only diagonally.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:202:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:203:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:204:- The grid has one dominant background color and exactly two foreground colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:205:- One foreground color is an enclosing frame: its bbox strictly contains the bbox of the other, inner color.
