/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:211:Key insight: The inner color marks the color to use, while the frame's diagonal-only background neighbors define the cells to add.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:212:</description>
