/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:235:Slide each black border rectangle to the opposite border, recoloring its swept stripe orange and leaving the rectangle black at the far edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:236:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:237:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:238:- The grid contains black rectangular 4-connected masks, each touching exactly one outer border.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:239:- Grey cells form incidental pattern content; orange is the trail color used when a black mask slides.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:240:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:241:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:242:- Treat all black rectangles as moving simultaneously.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:243:- A rectangle touching the top or bottom edge moves vertically to the opposite edge in the same columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:244:- A rectangle touching the left or right edge moves horizontally to the opposite edge in the same rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:245:- Recolor the complete swept row or column stripe to orange, then stamp every destination rectangle in black.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:246:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:247:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:248:- Edge contact gives the slide direction; the output is the set of opposite-edge black rectangles plus their orange trails.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/3.md:249:</description>
