/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:193:Expand the top-left seed mask into a recursive colored pattern and tile it across the full grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:194:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:195:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:196:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:197:- All foreground lies in a top-left rectangle whose last row and last column are a solid secondary color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:198:- Removing that secondary-color row and column leaves a seed region containing background plus one primary color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:199:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:200:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:201:- Use the primary-color pixels in the seed as a binary mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:202:- Replace each primary seed cell with a copy of the seed mask in the primary color, and each background seed cell
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:203:  with a copy of the seed mask in the secondary color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:204:- Repeat and crop that expanded tile to the original grid shape.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:205:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:206:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:207:The solid L-shaped secondary-color border is a legend, not output content; it supplies the color used when the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:208:seed's background cells are expanded.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:209:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:210:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:211:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:212:  "type": "symmetry/pattern",
