/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:214:  "transform": "expand the seed mask once: primary seed cells become primary-color copies of the mask, background seed cells become secondary-color copies, and mask background stays background; tile/crop the expanded pattern to the full grid"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:215:}
