/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:232:Drop the columns of the top marker downward, stopping blue-ended columns on grey obstacles and letting maroon-ended columns pass to the bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:233:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:234:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:235:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:236:- The most numerous non-background color forms stationary grey obstacle pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:237:- The other two colors form a single 3x3 top-edge marker whose top two rows
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:238:  are maroon and whose bottom row contains maroon or blue control pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:239:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:240:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:241:- Erase the top marker.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:242:- Treat each marker column as a vertical drop retaining its three colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:243:- A column whose bottom control pixel is blue stops immediately above the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:244:  first grey pixel below that column, or bottom-aligns if none exists.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:245:- Contiguous maroon-ended columns pass through obstacles and bottom-align;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:246:  if such a run has a clear down-right slide from a grey ledge, shift the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:247:  run one column right before bottom-aligning.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:248:- When a maroon-ended drop lands through a grey bar on the bottom edge, clear
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:249:  the rest of the marker-width gap in that bottom bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:250:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:251:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:252:- The bottom row of the top marker is a control strip: blue cells mean
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:253:  "stick to the first obstacle," while maroon cells mean "fall through."
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:254:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:255:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:256:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:257:  "type": "move_along_path",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:258:  "src": "columns of the 3x3 maroon/blue marker on the top edge; the bottom cell of each column is the control pixel",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:259:  "path": "vertical drop in each marker column; blue-ended columns stop above the first grey obstacle below, while maroon-ended runs pass through to the bottom with a one-column right slide from a clear grey ledge",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:260:  "trajectory": "copy each three-pixel marker column intact; contiguous maroon-ended columns are tested as one run for the slide",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:261:  "dst": "settled positions on the same canvas after erasing the top marker",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:262:  "transform": "if a maroon-ended drop lands through a grey bar on the bottom edge, clear the rest of the marker-width gap in that bar; leave other grey obstacles fixed"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:263:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:264:</annotation>
