/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:280:Grow an alternating pink/orange triangular trace downward from the horizontal orange seed row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:281:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:282:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:283:- The grid has a green background and one horizontal row containing all orange foreground pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:284:- The seed row may contain isolated orange pixels and adjacent orange runs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:285:- Pink is absent from the input and is used for the first generated row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:286:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:287:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:288:- Copy the input grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:289:- Two rows below the current active row, place a child pixel between each active pair
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:290:  whose middle cell in the current row is background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:291:- Alternate generated row colors between pink and orange, stopping when no children
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:292:  can be generated or the next row would leave the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:293:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:294:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:295:- Only an active-background-active triplet in the current row reproduces; contiguous
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:296:  active runs do not produce children through occupied middle cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:297:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:298:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:299:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:300:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:301:  "src": "horizontal orange seed row on green background",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:302:  "transform": "copy the input; every two rows downward, fill each green midpoint of an active-background-active triplet in the previous active row, alternating new rows pink then orange until no triplet remains"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:303:}
