/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:320:Rotate each blue-started chain of bottom-aligned vertical bars into horizontal bars resting on the same baseline.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:321:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:322:- The grid has a background and bottom-aligned, one-cell-wide vertical bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:323:- Blue bars are markers; red bars are body bars that may be chained after a marker.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:324:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:325:- Starting at each blue bar, repeatedly include the next red bar whose column is exactly the current bar's column plus the current bar's height.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:326:- Clear every included vertical bar, then redraw each included bar horizontally to the right from its original bottom cell, with length equal to its vertical height.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:327:- Red bars that are not reached from a blue marker remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:328:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:329:- A vertical bar's height is also the width it occupies after rotation, so the chain follows immediate horizontal contact after each rotated bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:330:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:331:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:332:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:333:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:334:  "src": "bottom-aligned one-cell-wide vertical bars on the background; blue bars start chains and red bars may follow",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:335:  "transform": "for each blue-started chain, rotate each reached vertical bar clockwise onto the shared baseline; the next red bar is reached when its column is exactly the current bar's column plus the current bar's height"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:336:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/5.md:337:</annotation>
