/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:189:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:190:- The grid has a background, one full-edge marker line, and monochrome hollow 3x3 foreground symbols.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:191:- The symbols lie on a coarse row/column lattice; fully empty lattice rows or columns are absent from the output.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:192:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:193:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:194:- Replace each hollow 3x3 symbol with one pixel of its color in the corresponding coarse-grid cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:195:- The marker edge gives the compaction direction by clockwise border travel: top -> right, right -> down, bottom -> left, left -> up.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:196:- Preserve the order of non-background pixels while sliding them as far as possible in that direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:197:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:198:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:199:- The large picture is a scaled symbolic grid, and the blue edge marker acts as a gravity direction rather than as output content.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:200:</description>
