/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:235:- Keep its shape and color unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:236:- Paste it with its bbox columns aligned to the top bracket's interior columns and with its bbox bottom aligned to the grid bottom.
