/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:264:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:265:Complete the sparse colored marker pattern by reflecting it across a full-row/full-column cross.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:266:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:267:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:268:The grid has a dominant background and one non-background cross color that
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:269:fills exactly one complete row and one complete column. All other foreground
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:270:pixels are sparse markers away from that cross.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:271:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:272:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:273:Keep the input unchanged, and for each marker pixel copy its color to the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:274:positions obtained by reflecting it across the cross row, across the cross
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:275:column, and across both axes. Reflected positions outside the grid are
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:276:clipped.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:277:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:278:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:279:The full cross is not a copied object; it is the pair of mirror axes for
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:280:completing the quadrant pattern.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:281:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/2.md:282:<annotation>
