/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:114:Move the left-edge fragment into its same-colored anchor fragment to complete a solid rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:115:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:116:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:117:- The grid has a dominant background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:118:- Exactly one foreground color is split into two 4-connected objects: one
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:119:  touches the left edge, and the other is an anchor away from the left edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:120:- The translated left-edge object and the anchor can form one filled rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:121:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:122:- Find the unique split color whose left-edge object can be translated onto
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:123:  background cells beside the other same-colored object so their union is a
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:124:  solid axis-aligned rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:125:- Clear the left-edge object's original cells to the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:126:- Paint that object at the unique completing offset, preserving all other cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:127:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:128:- The active color is identified by object structure and rectangle completion,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:129:  not by a fixed color id; the same-colored anchor object stays in place.
