/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:155:Fill hollow sprites' interiors using a color-palette legend on the grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:156:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:157:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:158:- bg = most common color. Several hollow sprites with distinct border colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:159:- A small 2×N or N×2 palette block sits on one grid edge; one row/column lists border colors, the other lists corresponding fill colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:160:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:161:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:162:- Locate the palette legend on a grid edge and read it as a border→fill color mapping.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:163:- Find enclosed bg regions (holes) inside sprites that don't touch the grid boundary.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:164:- For each hole, identify the most common adjacent border color, look it up in the palette, and fill the hole with the mapped fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:165:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:166:Key insight: The palette's edge position and orientation determine reading direction; border colors in the palette uniquely key into fill colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:167:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:168:<annotation>
