/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:204:Complete every colored sprite by applying the union of all aligned partial sprite masks.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:205:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:206:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:207:- The dominant color is the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:208:- Each non-background color appears as a separated partial copy of one common sprite mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:209:- The copies share a top-left-aligned sprite window; some copies may be missing lower or right edge pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:210:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:211:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:212:- Crop each same-color mask to its bounding box.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:213:- Pad the crops to the maximum observed height and width, aligned at the top-left, and OR them into one complete template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:214:- Fill that template at every sprite location using the sprite's own color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:215:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:216:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:217:- No single input sprite is complete, but their missing cells are complementary, so the aligned union reveals the full mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:218:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:219:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:220:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:221:  "type": "symmetry/pattern",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:222:  "src": "same-color partial sprite masks, one per foreground color, sharing a top-left-aligned window",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:223:  "transform": "pad smaller masks down/right to the largest observed window, recover the complete sprite as the union of all aligned masks, then fill that mask in each sprite window using that window's color"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:224:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:225:</annotation>
