/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:241:Erase the two leftmost columns of every foreground object, leaving the rest of each object in place.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:242:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:243:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:244:- A grid has one dominant background color and several monochromatic 4-connected foreground objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:245:- Each foreground object spans at least two columns in its bounding box.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:246:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:247:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:248:- Find each same-color 4-connected foreground object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:249:- Within each object's own bounding box, set foreground pixels in the two leftmost columns to the background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:250:- Leave all other pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:251:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:252:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:253:- The deletion is measured from each object's local left edge, not from the grid edge or from a shared global column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:254:</description>
