/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:277:Drop the moving-color objects downward until they rest above a one-row cushion before the obstacle or bottom edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:278:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:279:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:280:- The grid has exactly three colors: empty background, a stationary obstacle/floor color, and a moving object color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:281:- The obstacle color is the unique non-background role that touches the bottom edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:282:- Moving pixels start outside the obstacle cells, outside the row directly above each obstacle pixel, and outside the bottom row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:283:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:284:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:285:- Keep the background and obstacle pixels fixed.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:286:- Treat obstacle pixels, cells directly above obstacle pixels, and the bottom row as blocked.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:287:- Repeatedly move every 4-connected moving-color object one row down when its translated shape does not hit blocked cells or another moving object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:288:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:289:Key insight: The visible floor has an invisible one-row cushion above it, so the objects fall under gravity but stop with one empty row before the floor or the grid bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:290:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/1.md:291:<annotation>
