/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:80:Sort objects to top or bottom edge by whether their shape (up to rotation/flip) is shared.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:81:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:82:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:83:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:84:- Several multicolor connected components (8-connected) scattered across the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:85:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:86:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:87:- Compute each object's canonical shape (binary mask, invariant to rotation and flip).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:88:- Objects whose shape appears in two or more components → translate to TOP edge (row 0).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:89:- Objects whose shape is unique → translate to BOTTOM edge (row H−h).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:90:- Horizontal position (left column) is preserved; only vertical translation changes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:91:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:92:Key insight: The sorting criterion is shape frequency (rotation-invariant), not area — duplicated shapes go up, unique shapes go down.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:93:</description>
