/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:98:  "dst": "translate each object d vertically to an edge (x preserved)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:99:  "match_cond": "group objects by their pixel-count (area). If an area value occurs >=2 times, those objects go to the TOP edge; if the area is unique, that object goes to the BOTTOM edge",
