/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:156:Split the two-color object horizontally, swap its colors, and slide the upper half to the right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:157:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:158:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:159:- The grid has one background color and exactly two foreground colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:160:- All foreground pixels form one 4-connected object with an even-height bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:161:- The object has foreground pixels on both rows adjacent to its horizontal midpoint.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:162:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:163:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:164:- Split the object into upper and lower halves at the midpoint of its bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:165:- Swap the two foreground colors in both halves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:166:- Keep the lower half in place and shift the upper half right until its lower-left
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:167:  boundary pixel is diagonally adjacent to the lower half's upper-right boundary pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:168:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:169:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:170:- The object is not copied or reflected; it is broken at the horizontal waist,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:171:  recolored by exchanging the two visible object colors, then rejoined diagonally.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:172:</description>
