/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:200:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:201:- The dominant color is the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:202:- One non-background guide color touches the boundary and forms exactly two full parallel bars plus a split perpendicular center bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:203:- The other non-background color is a single 8-connected interior object whose area determines the flattened line length.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:204:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:205:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:206:- If the guide pair is vertical, make a vertical object-colored line centered between those bars; otherwise use the analogous horizontal line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:207:- The line length equals the number of interior object pixels and is centered on the split perpendicular guide bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:208:- Rebuild the guide color as the perpendicular center bar plus two full bars immediately beside the flattened object line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:209:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:210:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:211:- The guide bars supply only the orientation and center; the interior object's pixel count supplies the length of the final one-cell-thick line.
