/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:273:Move each gray bar into its adjacent orange rectangle as full stripes from the contacted edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:274:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:275:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:276:- The scene uses black outside space, yellow fill, gray one-cell-thick bars, and solid orange rectangles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:277:- Each gray bar 4-touches exactly one orange rectangle; some orange rectangles have no touching gray bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:278:- Gray bars touching the same orange rectangle all have the same orientation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:279:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:280:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:281:- Recolor every original gray cell to yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:282:- For each orange rectangle touched by gray bars, count the gray cells assigned to that rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:283:- Horizontal gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange rows starting from the contacted top or bottom row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:284:- Vertical gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange columns starting from the contacted left or right column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:285:- Orange rectangles with no touching gray bar remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:286:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:287:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:288:- The gray pixels are not copied by shape; their count is transferred into the neighboring orange rectangle as edge-aligned row or column stripes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:289:</description>
