/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:316:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:317:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:318:- The top row is a full-width bar in one foreground color and the bottom row is a full-width bar in another.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:319:- All other foreground pixels are 8-connected monochrome objects whose color matches one of those bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:320:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:321:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:322:- Top-bar-colored objects move upward so their bbox top is row 1.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:323:- Bottom-bar-colored objects move downward so their bbox bottom is the row above the bottom bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:324:- A downward-moving one-column segment whose landing overlaps its source becomes the continuous vertical segment swept between them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:325:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:326:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.md:327:The horizontal bars are destination anchors: color determines which border an object slides toward, while columns and object shape are otherwise preserved.
