/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:94:Sort objects to top or bottom edge by whether their shape (up to rotation/flip) is shared.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:95:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:96:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:97:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:98:- Several multicolor connected components (8-connected) scattered across the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:100:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:101:- Compute each object's canonical shape (binary mask, invariant to rotation and flip).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:102:- Objects whose shape appears in two or more components → translate to TOP edge (row 0).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:103:- Objects whose shape is unique → translate to BOTTOM edge (row H−h).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:104:- Horizontal position (left column) is preserved; only vertical translation changes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:105:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:106:Key insight: The sorting criterion is shape frequency (rotation-invariant), not area — duplicated shapes go up, unique shapes go down.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:107:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:108:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:109:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:110:  "type": "move_in_order",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:111:  "src": "all connected components (objects) on the background",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:112:  "dst": "translate each object d vertically to an edge (x preserved)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:113:  "match_cond": "group objects by their pixel-count (area). If an area value occurs >=2 times, those objects go to the TOP edge; if the area is unique, that object goes to the BOTTOM edge",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:114:  "transform": "duplicated-size -> top; singleton-size -> bottom"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:115:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:116:</annotation>
