/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:131:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:132:Pack the colored sprites along the bottom edge from smallest to largest.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:133:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:134:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:135:The grid has a dominant background color and several monochrome 4-connected
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:136:foreground sprites; a full-grid one-cell frame may surround the scene.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:137:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:138:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:139:Remove any full-grid rectangular frame, sort the remaining sprites by pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:140:area from smallest to largest, and paste their bounding-box sprites left to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:141:right with each sprite bottom-aligned.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:142:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:143:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:144:The original locations do not determine the final slots; each sprite's area
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:145:gives the packing order, while its shape and color are preserved.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:146:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:147:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:148:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:149:  "type": "move_in_order",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:150:  "src": "monochrome 4-connected foreground sprites excluding any full-grid one-cell frame",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:151:  "dst": "pack into the bottom-left corner from smallest to largest by pixel area",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:152:  "transform": "clear original positions; preserve each sprite's shape and color; bottom-align bounding-box sprites with no horizontal gaps"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:153:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:154:</annotation>
