/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:169:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:170:Split the two-color object horizontally, swap its colors, and slide the upper half to the right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:171:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:172:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:173:- The grid has one background color and exactly two foreground colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:174:- All foreground pixels form one 4-connected object with an even-height bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:175:- The object has foreground pixels on both rows adjacent to its horizontal midpoint.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:176:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:177:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:178:- Split the object into upper and lower halves at the midpoint of its bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:179:- Swap the two foreground colors in both halves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:180:- Keep the lower half in place and shift the upper half right until its lower-left
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:181:  boundary pixel is diagonally adjacent to the lower half's upper-right boundary pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:182:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:183:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:184:- The object is not copied or reflected; it is broken at the horizontal waist,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:185:  recolored by exchanging the two visible object colors, then rejoined diagonally.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:186:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:187:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:188:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:189:  "type": "move_along_path",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:190:  "src": "upper half s of the single two-color foreground object split at its horizontal midpoint",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:191:  "path": "translate s right until its bottom-row leftmost foreground pixel is diagonally adjacent to the lower half's top-row rightmost foreground pixel",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:192:  "trajectory": "place only the final translated upper-half sprite; leave no trail",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:193:  "dst": "endpoint beside the fixed lower half",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:194:  "transform": "exchange the two foreground colors in both halves; keep the lower half in place and clear the original upper-half cells"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:195:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:196:</annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:197:</reference_puzzle>
