/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:212:Flatten the interior object into a centered line and move the guide bars inward to bracket it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:213:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:214:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:215:- The dominant color is the background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:216:- One non-background guide color touches the boundary and forms exactly two full parallel bars plus a split perpendicular center bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:217:- The other non-background color is a single 8-connected interior object whose area determines the flattened line length.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:218:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:219:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:220:- If the guide pair is vertical, make a vertical object-colored line centered between those bars; otherwise use the analogous horizontal line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:221:- The line length equals the number of interior object pixels and is centered on the split perpendicular guide bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:222:- Rebuild the guide color as the perpendicular center bar plus two full bars immediately beside the flattened object line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:223:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:224:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:225:- The guide bars supply only the orientation and center; the interior object's pixel count supplies the length of the final one-cell-thick line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:226:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:227:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:228:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:229:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:230:  "src": "same-shape grid with a boundary-touching guide color forming two full parallel bars plus a split perpendicular center bar, and one 8-connected interior object color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:231:  "transform": "replace the scene with the guide color as the perpendicular center bar and two adjacent bars bracketing a one-cell object-colored line; orient the line parallel to the full guide-bar pair, center it on the perpendicular bar, and set its length to the interior object area"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:232:}
