/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:290:- The scene uses black outside space, yellow fill, gray one-cell-thick bars, and solid orange rectangles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:291:- Each gray bar 4-touches exactly one orange rectangle; some orange rectangles have no touching gray bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:292:- Gray bars touching the same orange rectangle all have the same orientation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:293:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:294:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:295:- Recolor every original gray cell to yellow.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:296:- For each orange rectangle touched by gray bars, count the gray cells assigned to that rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:297:- Horizontal gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange rows starting from the contacted top or bottom row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:298:- Vertical gray bars repaint that many cells as complete orange columns starting from the contacted left or right column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:299:- Orange rectangles with no touching gray bar remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:300:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:301:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:302:- The gray pixels are not copied by shape; their count is transferred into the neighboring orange rectangle as edge-aligned row or column stripes.
