/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:330:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:331:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:332:- The top row is a full-width bar in one foreground color and the bottom row is a full-width bar in another.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:333:- All other foreground pixels are 8-connected monochrome objects whose color matches one of those bars.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:334:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:335:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:336:- Top-bar-colored objects move upward so their bbox top is row 1.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:337:- Bottom-bar-colored objects move downward so their bbox bottom is the row above the bottom bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:338:- A downward-moving one-column segment whose landing overlaps its source becomes the continuous vertical segment swept between them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:339:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:340:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:341:The horizontal bars are destination anchors: color determines which border an object slides toward, while columns and object shape are otherwise preserved.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1026159725/14/codegen_prompts/4.codex2.log:342:</description>
